s","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Bakeries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Event Planning & Services","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Caterers","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"9wFFQUCn1j35CYea_dqhsg","review_id":"ze-nahkYltBkyI-kae3j0g","date":"2018-05-26T21:22:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9390137195587158,"text_excerpt":"I love eating La Madeleine for lunch! When I lived in Baton Rouge, I would go all the time. Now, I don't live as close to a location, but it's worth the drive if you're looking for something fresh and light. I love getting the pasta salad and country potato soup with cheese and bacon every time I go. For some reason, I love the sides more than I love the entrées. It's always hard for me to decide on an entree because I don't have a favorite. I'm not sure if they still have this, but I used to love getting the salmon Caesar salad. I also really like the chicken friand. It's a nice savory puff pastry with mushroom sauce on top that looks small but is very filling. I always find myself rando..."},{"business_id":"9wFFQUCn1j35CYea_dqhsg","review_id":"xAiRhmNIb3-Lk0Mbv4hlsw","date":"2018-08-17T07:44:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9316656589508057,"text_excerpt":"I have not tried their pastries (yet), but I'm a fan of their salads. The one I got was full of delicious pecans and cranberries, and the vinaigrette was very well balanced. The perfect lunch on a hot summer day. It's a pleasant place to chill for a while. Nice workers, and there's bread and butter that I assume is free to snack on (at least I hope it is considering I helped myself)."},{"business_id":"9wFFQUCn1j35CYea_dqhsg","review_id":"QcT6eEA4YFhKvZRaBzs1HQ","date":"2014-01-17T05:42:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9300030469894409,"text_excerpt":"I know someone is totally going to call me out on this, but I love love love Le Madeleine's Chicken Caesar Salad and, short of someone making the dressing fresh in front of me, it's the best I've ever had. I am also head over heels for their potato soup with cheese and bacon. And it's not fake old bacon bits, it's real bacon. I use the complimentary bread and basically eat the entire thing by bread dip instead of with a spoon. This La Madeleine is small and parking can be a little bit of a stink, but I don't mind coming here by myself to enjoy lunch. I also do to-go often from here, though the salad isn't a quarter as good as when they make it in the restaurant. I've considered buying the..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"9wFFQUCn1j35CYea_dqhsg","photo_id":"f9yIOskqpR1lzuwSq45Www","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/f9yIOskqpR1lzuwSq45